  "prefLabel": "En 1012.14 Group Member Cost Responsibilities",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "En 1012.14 Group Member Cost Responsibilities. The applicant shall be responsible for the pro rata portion of the common system modifications identified in the group study based on export capacity of the facility and total export capacity of the group.\n\nSource. #14657, eff 9-1-26, EXPIRES: 9-1-36",
